margin: 0, marginTop: 6 }}>SQLite 8 张表；后台守护线程每 30 秒扫描到期复习任务。</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 460, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 14 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>可插拔智能体</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.45, margin: 0, marginTop: 6 }}>6 个 Provider；无密钥时自动降级 DemoProvider，离线跑通全流程。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 24, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 4 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>图 2  V1.5.0 系统架构（单一零依赖后端）</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 50, background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>一条 python server.py 即可启动，适配答辩机房与离线演示场景。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>11 / 18</Text></Box></Slide>